flowchart TB
    Launch[App startup] --> Metadata[Load profile metadata]
    Metadata --> Active[Load active profile only]
    Active --> Browser[Display first usable browser screen]
    Browser --> OnDemand[Load other profile runtime on demand]
    OnDemand --> Features[Lazy-load History, Bookmarks, Downloads, Settings]
    Profile[Optional profile preloading] -. only when ResourceManager permits .-> OnDemand

    classDef start fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef flow fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef lazy fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    class Launch start
    class Metadata,Active,Browser flow
    class OnDemand,Features,Profile lazy
